<title>SWEDEN: Swedish industrial production up 2.6 pct March.</title>
<headline>Swedish industrial production up 2.6 pct March.</headline>
<dateline>STOCKHOLM 1997-05-27</dateline>
<text>
<p>Swedish industrial production rose 2.6 percent in March from February for a year-on-year rise of 9.3 percent, Statistics Sweden said on Tuesday.  </p>
<p>SWEDISH INDUSTRIAL PRODUCTION    March 97   Feb 97   March 96</p>
<p>(Percentage change)</p>
<p>Month-on-month			 2.6	  -0.2	 0.4</p>
<p>Year-on-year			   9.3	   7.2	 1.5</p>
<p>Index (1990=100)		   131.7	 122.6     120.5</p>
<p>NOTE - Indices are not seasonally adjusted.</p>
<p>-- Abigail Schmelz, Stockholm newsroom +46-8-700-1003</p>
